  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "The second release candidate for 1.0, on Avalonia 12.1.5 and MudBlazor 9.12: the forked templates are Avalonia 12.1.5's, and the package needs it; the look follows MudBlazor 9.12, which adds a divider with content and styles the text avatar. A command bar's overflow now scrolls, and a date picker opened with the pointer no longer draws the keyboard ring.\n\nWhat changed, and how to upgrade: https://github.com/FiliArrochada/Fili.Theme.MudAvalonia/blob/421a8d5bb8a3871049b34f2842537d49da558e77/docs/versions/1.0.0-rc.2.md",
